code/

dot_agents/plans/*
# Skills in ~/.agents/skills. The lockfile says who owns each one.
# In the lockfile: `npx skills` owns it. .chezmoiignore skips it, so listing it
# here does nothing. A new machine gets it back with `npx skills`.
# Not in the lockfile: chezmoi owns it. Allowlist it, or it stays on one machine.
# origin is public. Never allowlist a skill from a private repo.
# TODO: most entries below are in the lockfile and can go.
dot_agents/skills/*
dot_agents/dot_skill-lock.json
!dot_agents/skills/anti-ai-writing-style/
